  "description": "The fortune teller 'Goddess', who was a con artist who never had a sincere communication with anyone due to her distrust of people, meets the grandson of a conglomerate, 'Hansu', and is scouted as a fortune teller who can tell the big and small stories of the conglomerate family! The beautiful con artist Goddess, who became the conglomerate's exclusive fortune teller, goes on a wild ride with fortune-telling! ... Will she be able to survive in the conglomerate family without being caught? The hilarious, comic romance 'God's Hand' that's more dramatic than the drama begins now!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=3709855), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/ofgod_), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/hansu_of_god), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/66678155), KToon, [Blice](https://www.blice.co.kr/mw/detail.kt?novelId=99006)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n•S.Chinese: [AC.QQ](https://ac.qq.com/Comic/comicInfo/id/646944), [BiliBili](https://manga.bilibili.com/detail/mc27840), [KuaiKan](https://www.kuaikanmanhua.com/web/topic/2469/), [IQIYI](https://www.iqiyi.com/manhua/detail_knaw8pv9kl.html)",
